WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:07.510
Hey Thoughty2 here, conspiracy theorists are
often mocked and called tin-foil hat wearing

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:14.570
loonies, but whatever people may say, they
have got the occasional thing correct.

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:21.540
And sometimes the truth is even scarier than
speculations and theories.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:29.970
These are the terrifying conspiracy theories
that turned out to be true.

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:33.820
1.

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:38.290
We start with the conspiracy of the MKUltra
project.

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:47.640
The theory goes that between 1950 and 1973
the CIA carried out top secret and disturbing

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:51.860
mind control experiments on US citizens.

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:56.600
Unfortunately the theories turned out to be
very true.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:05.530
In 1995 President Clinton actually issued
a formal apology on behalf of the US government

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:08.310
for the atrocities they committed.

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:15.420
The experiments carried out as part of the
MKUltra project were highly illegal.

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:22.290
All the test subjects where unwilling and
the experiments involved drugs, electronics,

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:30.299
hypnosis, sensory deprivations, verbal and
sexual abuse, and torture.

00:01:30.299 --> 00:01:38.060
To distance the project from the US government
the CIA subcontracted the work to 80 different

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:44.530
institutions, including universities, hospitals
and prisons.

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:52.920
20,000 classified MKUltra documents were uncovered
to the public in 1977 under the Freedom of

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:57.880
Information act, which confirmed people's
suspicious.

00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:05.479
However the director of the CIA, Richard Helms
had most of the more damming MKUltra files

00:02:05.479 --> 00:02:13.830
destroyed in 1973, so much of what happened
during the experiments is still unknown to

00:02:13.830 --> 00:02:14.830
this day.

00:02:14.830 --> 00:02:15.830
2.

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:22.989
Next up is the great diamond conspiracy, during
the late 1870s when huge diamond mines were

00:02:22.989 --> 00:02:29.870
opened in South Africa it was suspected that
the diamond supply was actually far greater

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:37.440
than advertised and the price of diamonds
had been artificially inflated, conspiracy

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:42.050
theorists believed that diamonds were actually
worthless.

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:45.980
Well, they couldn't be closer to the truth.

00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:52.940
Until the 19th century diamonds were only
found in very small quantities in riverbeds

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:56.160
in India and the jungles of Brazil.

00:02:56.160 --> 00:03:03.400
However, in 1870, huge diamond mines were
found in South Africa and diamonds were soon

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:06.240
being mined by the truck load.

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:10.879
Very soon the market was flooded with an excessive
amount of diamonds.

00:03:10.879 --> 00:03:16.739
The British investors who funded the diamond
mines soon realised that the price of diamonds

00:03:16.739 --> 00:03:21.340
rested solely on the fact that they were so
rare.

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:27.380
If too many diamonds came into the market
their price would plummet, diamonds would

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:34.209
no longer be a precious stone and their investment
would be worth nothing.

00:03:34.209 --> 00:03:36.230
So what did they do?

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:42.930
The investors realised they had to restrict
the supply of diamonds to keep the prices

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:44.069
high.

00:03:44.069 --> 00:03:51.750
So in 1888 the handful of British diamond
mine investors banded together into a single

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:58.350
entity to form a cartel, called De Beers Consolidated
Mines.

00:03:58.350 --> 00:04:05.130
In one fell swoop they had completely monopolised
the diamond market worldwide.

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:11.150
The global selling price of diamonds was now
completely under their control.

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:17.229
The De Beers corporation achieved this by
stockpiling massive quantities of diamonds

00:04:17.229 --> 00:04:24.779
in London warehouses and only releasing a
tiny amount into the market each year to create

00:04:24.779 --> 00:04:27.099
an illusion of scarcity.

00:04:27.099 --> 00:04:34.460
But De Beers soon realised that only wealthy
individuals were buying their diamonds because

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:36.939
the prices were so high.

00:04:36.939 --> 00:04:43.620
So they needed a way to encourage the working
and middle classes to buy diamonds.

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:51.699
So in 1938 they came up with one of the greatest
scams of the modern day, they invented the

00:04:51.699 --> 00:04:54.330
diamond engagement ring.

00:04:54.330 --> 00:05:00.819
De Beers utilised the newly emerging medium
of motion pictures to plant the idea in the

00:05:00.819 --> 00:05:07.860
heads of young men worldwide that the only
stone acceptable for an engagement ring is

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:09.199
a diamond.

00:05:09.199 --> 00:05:16.210
They paid Hollywood movie studios to include
scenes in their movies of young men proposing

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:20.289
to their loved ones with a diamond engagement
ring.

00:05:20.289 --> 00:05:27.639
They also launched a massive advertising campaign
with the slogan "a diamond is forever".

00:05:27.639 --> 00:05:30.740
The campaign was an enormous success.

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:40.180
Before their campaign only 10% of engagement
rings sold worldwide had diamonds on them,

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:45.059
after the campaign 80% had diamonds.

00:05:45.059 --> 00:05:51.469
In a short few years the De Beers company
had artificially inflated the global price

00:05:51.469 --> 00:05:57.479
of diamonds and brainwashed the entire world
into thinking that these worthless hunks of

00:05:57.479 --> 00:06:02.080
carbon are the only way to propose to a woman.

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:08.479
To this day their mass manipulation is still
deeply rooted in society.

00:06:08.479 --> 00:06:09.479
3.

00:06:09.479 --> 00:06:17.419
The Gulf of Tonkin incident was a major event
in 1964 that was one of the biggest contributing

00:06:17.419 --> 00:06:20.610
factors to the start of the Vietnam War.

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:27.900
However conspiracy theorists say the event
never actually happened.

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:36.149
The story goes that the US destroyer ship
USS Maddox engaged three North Vietnamese

00:06:36.149 --> 00:06:43.729
Navy torpedo boats in the Gulf of Tonkin near
Vietnam, as part of a US intelligence patrol.

00:06:43.729 --> 00:06:47.379
The Maddox fired an incredible 300 shells.

00:06:47.379 --> 00:06:50.490
That much is true.

00:06:50.490 --> 00:06:59.349
However in 2005 a study by the NSA revealed
that there weren't actually any Vietnamese

00:06:59.349 --> 00:07:03.840
naval vessels present during the incident
whatsoever.

00:07:03.840 --> 00:07:09.970
USS Maddox was firing at nothing.

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:18.419
In 1965, President Johnson actually said "For
all I know, our Navy was shooting at whales

00:07:18.419 --> 00:07:19.710
out there."

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:20.749
4.

00:07:20.749 --> 00:07:30.379
Next up is the conspiracy theory that between
1932 and 1972 the US Public Health Service

00:07:30.379 --> 00:07:38.349
were deliberately not treating syphilis patients
as part of a clinical study to see what would

00:07:38.349 --> 00:07:42.449
happen to syphilis patients if left untreated.

00:07:42.449 --> 00:07:47.619
Unfortunately, this turned out to be very
true.

00:07:47.619 --> 00:07:57.009
399 rural African American men were chosen
by the US Public Health Service who were suffering

00:07:57.009 --> 00:08:03.840
from syphilis, the health service never even
informed these men that they had a sexually

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:11.369
transmitted disease, and they never offered
them treatment of any kind, despite the treatment

00:08:11.369 --> 00:08:14.529
for syphilis being widely available.

00:08:14.529 --> 00:08:22.249
The victims were simply told they had "bad
blood" and their symptoms were inevitable.

00:08:22.249 --> 00:08:34.740
By the early 1970s, 128 of the 399 men had
died of syphilis, 40 of their wives had contracted

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:41.870
the disease and 19 of their children had been
born with congenital syphilis.

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:42.870
5.

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:49.480
Next up is the theory that the joint chiefs
of staff of the US military created plans

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:58.379
to create fake acts of terrorism against US
citizen on US soil in a Cuban false flag attack

00:08:58.379 --> 00:09:04.130
to persuade the American public to support
the war against Cuba.

00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:09.360
It's completely true and the official documents
can be found online.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:15.750
The plan which was drawn up by the US military
involved shooting down innocent Americans

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:17.490
on the streets.

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:25.470
Planes full of innocent people being hijacked
and shot down, and other extremely violent

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:32.399
bouts of terrorism taking place against the
American public in Washington D.C., Miami,

00:09:32.399 --> 00:09:35.980
and elsewhere across the US.

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:43.730
The plan was approved and ready to go into
action, but thankfully President Kennedy rejected

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:44.730
it.

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:45.730
6.

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:52.290
Perhaps one of the most well believed conspiracy
theories is that your government is spying

00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:53.670
on you.

00:09:53.670 --> 00:10:00.269
We've all had that paranoid feeling at some
point in our lives, that someone, somewhere

00:10:00.269 --> 00:10:01.939
is watching us.

00:10:01.939 --> 00:10:09.209
Maybe it was George Orwell's 1984 that started
it all off or just a general distrust of the

00:10:09.209 --> 00:10:16.610
government, but whatever started the theories,
the scary truth is, your government is watching

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:20.810
you, and it's not just in America that it's
happening.

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:27.370
In recent years there have also been disturbing
reports of other countries spying on their

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:36.589
own citizens, such as France, Germany, China,
Russia, Syria, New Zealand, Canada and the

00:10:36.589 --> 00:10:38.550
United Kingdom.

00:10:38.550 --> 00:10:45.540
Of course the most well known of these spying
scandals was when former NSA employee, Edward

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:52.810
Snowden released sensitive government information,
revealing the frightening extent of the NSA's

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:59.649
spying activities on American citizens, under
it's surveillance program, codenamed PRISM.

00:10:59.649 --> 00:11:06.810
Thanks to these revelations, we now know that
the scope of the NSA's eavesdropping is even

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:11.050
larger that what conspiracy theorists originally
believed.

00:11:11.050 --> 00:11:17.529
But of course, all this spying is necessary
to protect us from the likes of terrorists,

00:11:17.529 --> 00:11:19.230
is it not?

00:11:19.230 --> 00:11:26.339
Well not exactly, a report by the Washington
Post found that 90% of the sensitive data

00:11:26.339 --> 00:11:33.459
being collected by the NSA's surveillance
programmes is from Internet users with absolutely

00:11:33.459 --> 00:11:37.140
no connection to terrorist activities.

00:11:37.140 --> 00:11:40.480
Making their spying activities downright illegal.

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:41.480
7.

00:11:41.480 --> 00:11:50.160
For a long time it's been theorised that professional
wrestling is fake and the outcomes of the

00:11:50.160 --> 00:11:53.860
matches are determined beforehand.

00:11:53.860 --> 00:12:02.430
It's always been a popular theory, until recently,
when it was confirmed to be true.

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:11.350
in 2013 a mysterious reddit user called Dolphins1925
who claims he has a contact inside the World

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:17.889
Wrestling Entertainment company, started posting
the results of pay-per-view wrestling matches

00:12:17.889 --> 00:12:22.980
online, before they actually took place.

00:12:22.980 --> 00:12:30.250
He posted the results of 38 matches, all of
which he got correct.

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:37.040
Which proved once and for all that pro wrestling,
well at least in the case of WWE matches,

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:40.930
are as many suspected, setup.

00:12:40.930 --> 00:12:41.930
8.

00:12:41.930 --> 00:12:47.899
Between 1920 and 1933 in the US was the alcohol
prohibition.

00:12:47.899 --> 00:12:54.550
For a whole 13 years alcoholic beverages in
any form were banned.

00:12:54.550 --> 00:12:58.540
As you would expect, this proved very hard
to enforce.

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:04.629
A lot of people were secretly making their
own alcohol in their homes.

00:13:04.629 --> 00:13:10.680
The FBI were finding it increasingly more
difficult to stop people drinking.

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:18.850
Then suddenly, people started dying from drinking
alcoholic beverages, many theories popped

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:26.089
up that claimed the FBI was intentionally
poisoning liquor to deter people from drinking

00:13:26.089 --> 00:13:27.220
it.

00:13:27.220 --> 00:13:32.800
It's frightening to believe, but the theories
were absolutely correct.

00:13:32.800 --> 00:13:39.709
The FBI's idea was that by adding potentially
fatal impurities to liquor it would demonise

00:13:39.709 --> 00:13:45.559
alcohol in the eyes of the general public
and stop people from wanting to drink.

00:13:45.559 --> 00:13:51.439
Of course they didn't tell the public about
their nefarious plan, they let the consequences

00:13:51.439 --> 00:13:55.699
of the poisoned liquors do all the talking
for them.

00:13:55.699 --> 00:14:02.810
The FBI added substances such as kerosene,
chloroform and acetone to bottles of liquor,

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:09.860
and people started mysteriously dying of what
many believed was simply alcohol poisoning.

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:10.860
9.

00:14:10.860 --> 00:14:16.750
It's long been believed by conspiracy theorists
the world over that the world is run by a

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:23.630
group of rich men in powerful positions and
that they meet up every year to discuss secret

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:29.749
plans, one such theory is that the world's
elite meet up once a year in the middle of

00:14:29.749 --> 00:14:34.040
the woods and worship a giant owl effigy.

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:38.990
Well turns out it's true, it's called the
Bohemian Grove.

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:47.240
It's a 2,700-acre campground located in the
woods of Monte Rio, California.

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:54.300
Once a year Bohemian Grove is host to a two
week event involving some of the most powerful

00:14:54.300 --> 00:14:56.470
men in the world.

00:14:56.470 --> 00:15:03.749
During the event they get drunk, put on strange
plays in the woods and burn an effigy in front

00:15:03.749 --> 00:15:06.490
of a giant owl statue.

00:15:06.490 --> 00:15:13.010
However little is known about the event and
what exactly is discussed by the rich and

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:16.430
powerful is kept top secret.

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:19.269
Women aren't allowed to attend.

00:15:19.269 --> 00:15:27.129
Famous Bohemian Grove members have included:
Dick Cheney, both George Bushes, Ronald Reagan,

00:15:27.129 --> 00:15:32.759
Richard Nixon, John Major, David Rockefeller,
former C.I.A.

00:15:32.759 --> 00:15:38.839
director William Casey, the former CEO of
IBM, Thomas J. Watson and many more.

00:15:38.839 --> 00:15:39.839
10.

00:15:39.839 --> 00:15:41.579
And finally.

00:15:41.579 --> 00:15:47.879
Conspiracy Theorists believed that the CIA
invented a heart attack gun that can be used

00:15:47.879 --> 00:15:51.690
to assassinate people without a trace.

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:54.399
Turns out this is terrifyingly true.

00:15:54.399 --> 00:15:59.820
The weapon does exist, it was developed in
the late 1960s.

00:15:59.820 --> 00:16:03.769
The gun was designed to be completely untraceable.

00:16:03.769 --> 00:16:11.369
It fires a tiny bullet about 3 millimetres
wide that is made entirely of ice.

00:16:11.369 --> 00:16:17.189
This ice bullet has a lethal shellfish toxin
frozen inside it.

00:16:17.189 --> 00:16:23.439
Upon entering the target the bullet would
leave only a tiny red dot on the skin, and

00:16:23.439 --> 00:16:28.990
the bullet itself would quickly melt, leaving
no trace at all.

00:16:28.990 --> 00:16:36.570
The shellfish toxin causes a heart attack
regardless of the target's physical fitness.

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:44.930
The toxin itself denatures quickly, meaning
an autopsy is unlikely to find any traces

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:45.930
of it.

00:16:45.930 --> 00:16:51.260
It is a perfectly, untraceable James Bond
style weapon.

00:16:51.260 --> 00:17:00.249
However it's existence was confirmed in 1975
when Senator Frank Church was forced to reveal

00:17:00.249 --> 00:17:07.600
the gun to a subcommittee whom were investigating
the CIA's illegal activities.

00:17:07.600 --> 00:17:13.720
Because assassinating someone on the streets
who doesn't pose a significant threat to the

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:18.890
state is illegal, even for the CIA.

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:24.649
Even though its existence is now undeniable
theorists believe it is still being used by

00:17:24.649 --> 00:17:26.920
the CIA to this day.

00:17:26.920 --> 00:17:33.820
Andrew Breitbart may very well have been a
victim, he was a media mogul whom published

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:37.990
derogatory stories about Barack Obama.

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:44.880
He promised that he would shortly publish
proof that Barack Obama's presidency was illegitimate.

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:53.820
But he never got to do so, because shortly
afterwards on the 1st March 2012 he suspiciously

00:17:53.820 --> 00:18:00.760
collapsed dead from a heart attack whilst
walking in a Los Angeles neighbourhood, despite

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:03.669
being of relatively good health.

00:18:03.669 --> 00:18:10.049
Another possible victim of the heart attack
gun was Mark Pittman, a financial journalist

00:18:10.049 --> 00:18:15.830
who sued the American Federal Reserve for
mishandling taxpayer's money.

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:23.200
However before the case could come to a conclusion
Pittman died of a heart attack in very similar

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:29.940
circumstances as Andrew Breitbart.

